review.description:
{summary}

After you save, MXZ Coordinator is installed but not controlling anything yet. Turn on "Coordinator enable" and each room's enable switch when you are ready.

MXZ owns each head's mode while a room is enabled. If a head is knocked off the coordinated mode, MXZ puts it back and can notify you. Your fan speed is the exception: turn a room's "Fan auto" switch off to hold the speed you chose. To stop MXZ in one room, turn that room's enable switch off; to stop it everywhere, turn "Coordinator enable" off.

